{
  "id": "cash_flow_diagrams",
  "title": "Cash Flow Diagrams",
  "description": "Calculate the future value of money using cash flow diagrams for loan and investment transactions with discount rates and present value analysis.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Cash Flow Diagrams\n\nThe future value of money.\n\n### Cash Flow Diagram - Loan Transaction\n\nA loan transaction starts with a positive cash flow when the loan is received - and continuous with negative cash flows for the pay offs.\n\n*   **Upward arrows** - positive cash flow (receiving the loan)\n*   **Downward arrows** - negative cash flow (pay off)\n\nThe **Present Value** of the cash flows can be calculated by multiplying each cash flow with a **Discount Rate**.\n\n### Cash Flow Diagram - Investment Transaction\n\nAn investment transaction starts with a negative cash flow when the investment is done - and continuous with positive cash flows when receiving the pay backs.\n\n*   **Upward arrows** - positive cash flows (pay back)\n*   **Downward arrows** - negative cash flow (investing)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Loan Transaction Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "loan_amount",
          "label": "Loan Amount",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10000,
          "unit": "$"
        },
        {
          "id": "discount_rate",
          "label": "Discount Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.05,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "periods",
          "label": "Number of Periods",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5,
          "unit": "years"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "present_value",
          "label": "Present Value",
          "formula": "inputs.loan_amount / Math.pow((1 + inputs.discount_rate), inputs.periods)",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        },
        {
          "id": "future_value",
          "label": "Future Value",
          "formula": "inputs.loan_amount * Math.pow((1 + inputs.discount_rate), inputs.periods)",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "headers": [
        "Investment Transaction Calculator"
      ],
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "investment_amount",
          "label": "Investment Amount",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 5000,
          "unit": "$"
        },
        {
          "id": "annual_return",
          "label": "Annual Return Rate",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 0.08,
          "unit": "%"
        },
        {
          "id": "investment_periods",
          "label": "Number of Periods",
          "type": "number",
          "defaultValue": 10,
          "unit": "years"
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "investment_present_value",
          "label": "Present Value of Investment",
          "formula": "inputs.investment_amount",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        },
        {
          "id": "investment_future_value",
          "label": "Future Value of Investment",
          "formula": "inputs.investment_amount * Math.pow((1 + inputs.annual_return), inputs.investment_periods)",
          "unit": "$",
          "format": "currency"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chart",
      "headers": [
        "Cash Flow Timeline Visualization"
      ],
      "options": {
        "tooltip": {
          "trigger": "axis",
          "axisPointer": {
            "type": "shadow"
          }
        },
        "legend": {
          "data": [
            "Loan Transaction",
            "Investment Transaction"
          ]
        },
        "xAxis": {
          "type": "category",
          "data": [
            "Year 0",
            "Year 1",
            "Year 2",
            "Year 3",
            "Year 4",
            "Year 5"
          ]
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "type": "value",
          "axisLabel": {
            "formatter": "{value}$"
          }
        },
        "series": [
          {
            "name": "Loan Transaction",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              10000,
              -2000,
              -2000,
              -2000,
              -2000,
              -2000
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#5470c6"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "Investment Transaction",
            "type": "bar",
            "data": [
              -5000,
              400,
              432,
              467,
              504,
              544
            ],
            "itemStyle": {
              "color": "#91cc75"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}